==='''Chapter 3'''===
Kid Tappa is a pushover as always and will give you all of the cash you need to easily rush this stage. Bring along [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] to quickly run the dolphin's pockets and use your earnings to spam [[Ancient Egg: N108 (Super Rare Cat)|Soap Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cats]], and [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. Suidae Piggicus may spawn before you reach the base, but Bahamut should be able to pave through it along with your Couriers. In the unlikely event that Angaburu causes issues and doesn't get reduced to ashes by Bahamut, you can add [[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Cat Chief]] to your roster. Fill any free spaces with combos of your choice, preferably Research [[Cat Combo]]s for more Couriers, or Worker Start Level Combos for a head start. The Deploy Limit restriction shouldn't make things too difficult.

